having the same full system freezes.\n\nIt consistently happens for me when I try to open already established projects (previously edited in Godot 4.5) in the newer stable build(s). (Tested in 4.6 Stable and 4.6.1 Stable)\n\nThese projects all use Forward+.\n\nMy system specs:\n- Desktop PC Build (Medion Akoya P5459 H/B681)\n- Windows 10 Home (22H2)\n- NVIDIA GTX 970\n- Intel i7-6700 3.40GHz\n- 16GB Ram\n\nGPU driver is up to date (GeForce Security Update Driver - WHQL , Version 582.28)\n(If I recall correctly, it also happened with the Game Ready Driver Version 581.57. I have updated since encountering the problem for the first time.)\n\nWorth mentioning:\nFor me, creating new projects works when using Forward+. (Tested in 4.6 Stable and 4.6.1 Stable)\nIt's only when trying to migrate older projects that the entire system freezes on opening a project.\n\nIt might just be my aging GPU. (An uneasy feeling, given the current prices lol)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4007603538/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4007660232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116414#issuecomment-4007660232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116414","id":4007660232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7u4ArI","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist